# Keep text as LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# A Windows core.autocrlf checkout otherwise expects CRLF, then reports a
# file as modified when a tool saves it with LF even though the normalized
# text is unchanged. Cargo.toml is the file that hits this.
# Store assets directly in Git, including when a global LFS filter is configured.
* text=auto eol=lf -filter

*.png -text -diff -eol
*.ico -text -diff -eol
*.icns -text -diff -eol
